OL,3,GNEWSAThe Gurkha families fighting for
OL,4,Atheir pensions
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow aged 87, Indumati Thapa's life
OL,7,Frevolves around a group of similarly
OL,8,Fwidowed women. Her husband, a former
OL,9,FGurkha who fought alongside the British
OL,10,Fin south east Asia, died in 2020.
OL,12,FHe left her a pension, but Gurkhas who
OL,13,Fretired before 1997 receive far less
OL,14,Fthan their British Army counterparts.
OL,16,FTheirs are based on Nepalese living
OL,17,Fcosts, not those of towns like Reading,
OL,18,Fwhere thousands of Gurkhas retired to.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
